    "answer": {
      "short": "$4\\frac{2}{9}=4.\\dot{2}$; $\\frac12=0.50$; $1\\frac13=1.\\dot3$; $\\frac9{100}=0.09$; $\\frac25=0.4$; $\\frac58=0.625$; $1\\frac14=1.25$.",
